          <span>ECOMAPP-FR Requirements</span>
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
          <li class="flex items-center space-x-2"><i data-lucide="check" class="w-4 h-4 text-green-500"></i><span>Delivered for Android devices</span></li>
